      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Samira:</b> The academy has authorized one active discovery check against its sandbox target. This probe can tell us whether the address responds, but it will not test ports or identify services.",
      "taskInstructions": "In Zenmap, type <b>nmap -sn -PR</b> into the highlighted command field, then type <b>185.254.57.124</b> into the highlighted target field. Select <b>Scan</b>, review the Nmap Output, then select the completed result to finish.",
